This project uses two Apache-2.0 libraries as unmodified, pinned pip dependencies:

- statsforecast (Nixtla), https://github.com/Nixtla/statsforecast, Apache License 2.0
- OR-Tools (Google LLC), https://github.com/google/or-tools, Apache License 2.0

No upstream library files are copied or modified in this repository.
upstream_smoke/ortools_simple_sat_program.py is the official OR-Tools sample
ortools/sat/samples/simple_sat_program.py (Copyright 2010-2025 Google LLC,
Apache-2.0), modified by adding one version print line.
upstream_smoke/statsforecast_quickstart.py reproduces the README quick-start
example of statsforecast, modified by adding print and timing lines.
